{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398870/extras/TitleLabel_en.png?t=1745236256\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>[Content Creation &amp; Streaming Guide]</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Please include an introduction to the game in your created content.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Please attach the game's store page link in the description, etc. (optional)</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have opened a new hair salon. As a salon designer, welcome customers and cut their hair. And stop the villains who interfere with your business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy multiplayer with friends for up to 4 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398870/extras/TitlePanel_m2.png?t=1745236256\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398870/extras/Screenshot01_Cut.gif?t=1745236256\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customers with ridiculous hairstyles visit every day. Cut their hair refreshingly and earn money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398870/extras/TitlePanel_m1.png?t=1745236256\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398870/extras/Screenshot00.png?t=1745236256\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You must survive by running a hair salon in a chaotic town. Survive among strange customers and the threat of the mafia!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398870/extras/TitlePanel_m3.png?t=1745236256\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398870/extras/Screenshot03_Grow.png?t=1745236256\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expand your salon, install furniture, and create the store you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Automate annoying tasks to gain more free time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Perfect Setting","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3398870/82ed58742b785e5d2c644bfda71a44c12d47710d.jpg"},{"name":"Room of Time","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3398870/415abf579d9276db31b5d26627b4d1b5c98db78c.jpg"},{"name":"Ruthless","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3398870/2a9dd15de753be56139efe7d2dd1564fdbe4403c.jpg"},{"name":"Exchange","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3398870/7517c762a530056ba744d655d7c0f79aaabb7987.jpg"},{"name":"Watch Out for Stones","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3398870/3af17e44db290d541384e308926cc200f12a18c0.jpg"},{"name":"Traffic Accident","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3398870/11d4a829a0b65c0537190cb5005e237614808610.jpg"},{"name":"Doom's Hair Salon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3398870/0f2be06e3b1688b3f2f6472b60b20393ff27c6da.jpg"},{"name":"First Customer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3398870/59d9c6f090a46ed17c025853ff44c10c563bcd9d.jpg"},{"name":"10th Customer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3398870/561164d4f5de0bb92c75e71f9741d183fd4e365a.jpg"},{"name":"N